WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.700
JP guards the recorded gold OD uppercut.

2
00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:02.200
Standing heavy punch scores punish counter on the landing recovery.

3
00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:02.700
Light-plus-heavy-punch OD Departure places the recorded portals.

4
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:03.250
Standing medium kick connects before the next portal input.

5
00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:04.950
The performed heavy portal input continues while the OD portals supply attacks.

6
00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:06.200
After dashing under Ryu, forward heavy kick connects facing left.

7
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:06.700
Standing heavy punch catches medium Stribog’s juggle.

8
00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:07.450
Heavy Triglav continues the conversion.

9
00:00:07.450 --> 00:00:08.300
Medium-plus-heavy-punch OD Departure establishes the final portal state.
